10. Do not claim a feature works until its actual implementation has been tested.
11. Do not silently replace a failing backend with mock data.
12. Keep the architecture modular, maintainable, reusable, and documented.
13. Preserve data when updating the application. Never delete existing data during a migration without explicit authorization.
